    "collapsible_content_caQGjh": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_Nzeaa4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I manage my account?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Click book now and you can choose the availability for your float.</p><p>You will also see Account option so you can log in with your username and password.</p><p>Once into your account click ” ME” to manage your account and to see all your history.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MTfiUq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I change the time or date of my appointment?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, we ask that you only change appointments at least 24 hours before your scheduled time. Please give us a quick call or message to arrange your new appointment time.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_bAYeUd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How are memberships cancelled?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We only ask that people pay for the month they are in, and should someone decide they don’t want to keep their membership for the best value, we’d simply stop the auto-pay to prevent further payments being taken. We hope that most people will love the experience, and want to continue to experience the compounding benefits of a regular floating practice!</p><p>You can cancel this contract  with 10 days written cancellation notice (manager@floathub.co.uk). We don’t accept cancellations over the phone, please confirm in writing via email.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_t6p9db": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When do membership payments get charged?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Membership payments are made every 30 days based on when you signed up. Every month provides you with one float session credit on your account which rolls over for up to 12 months and can be used at any time as long as your membership is active.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
